                  <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="setBtrcLicense">BTRC Registration / License Number</label><input id="setBtrcLicense" class="form-control" maxlength="200"></div>
                  <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="setCopyright">Footer Copyright Text</label><input id="setCopyright" class="form-control" maxlength="300" placeholder="© {year} {company_name}. All Rights Reserved."></div>
                </div><div id="systemBrandResult" class="small mt-3" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="d-flex justify-content-end mt-4"><button type="submit" id="systemBrandSaveBtn" class="btn btn-success">Save Brand Settings</button></div></form></div></div>
              </div>
              <div id="general-settings-panel-billing" class="general-settings-panel" style="display:none">
                <div class="card card-custom border-0 shadow-sm"><div class="card-custom-header"><i class="bi bi-calendar2-check text-success fs-5"></i><div><div class="fw-semibold">Billing &amp; Expiry Lifecycle</div><small class="text-muted fw-normal">These values are saved as policy settings; they do not immediately modify any active router secret.</small></div></div>
                <div class="card-body p-4"><form id="systemBillingForm" novalidate><div class="row g-4">
                  <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="setBillingCycle">Billing Cycle Type</label><select id="setBillingCycle" class="form-select"><option value="monthly_1st">Monthly calendar cycle (1st to month end)</option><option value="rolling_30">30-day rolling cycle</option></select></div>
                  <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="setGraceDays">Grace Period Before Line Cut (days)</label><input id="setGraceDays" type="number" class="form-control" min="0" max="7" step="1" value="0"></div>
                  <div class="col-12"><label class="form-label d-block">Action on Expiry</label>
                    <div class="form-check border rounded p-3 ps-5 mb-2"><input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="setExpiryAction" id="setExpiryQuarantine" value="quarantine" checked><label class="form-check-label" for="setExpiryQuarantine"><strong>Quarantine (recommended)</strong><div class="small text-muted">Assign EXPIRED-PROFILE / zero speed while keeping the secret and MAC visibility intact.</div></label></div>
                    <div class="form-check border rounded p-3 ps-5"><input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="setExpiryAction" id="setExpiryDisable" value="disable_secret"><label class="form-check-label" for="setExpiryDisable"><strong>Disable Secret</strong><div class="small text-muted">Disable the PPPoE secret when the expiry engine runs.</div></label></div>
                  </div>
                </div><div id="systemBillingResult" class="small mt-3" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="d-flex justify-content-end mt-4"><button type="submit" id="systemBillingSaveBtn" class="btn btn-success">Save Billing Policy</button></div></form></div></div>
              </div>
              <div id="general-settings-panel-sms" class="general-settings-panel" style="display:none">
                <div class="card card-custom border-0 shadow-sm"><div class="card-custom-header"><i class="bi bi-chat-dots text-success fs-5"></i><div><div class="fw-semibold">SMS Gateway &amp; Alerts</div><small class="text-muted fw-normal">Choose a delivery mode, then customize the message sent for each notification.</small></div></div>
                <div class="card-body p-4"><form id="systemSmsForm" novalidate>
                  <div class="row g-3 mb-4">
                    <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="setSmsMode">Gateway Provider Mode</label><select id="setSmsMode" class="form-select"><option value="bulk_sms">Commercial Bulk SMS (Masking / Non-Masking)</option><option value="personal_device">Personal Phone Forwarder (Android / MacroDroid / Custom App)</option><option value="disabled">Disabled</option></select></div>
                    <div class="col-12" id="setSmsBulkFields"><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-md-7"><label class="form-label" for="setSmsApiUrl">SMS API URL</label><input id="setSmsApiUrl" class="form-control" type="url" placeholder="https://api.greenweb.com.bd/g280/api.php"></div><div class="col-md-5"><label class="form-label" for="setSmsApiMethod">HTTP Method</label><select id="setSmsApiMethod" class="form-select"><option value="POST">POST</option><option value="GET">GET</option></select></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="setSmsApiKey">API Key / Token</label><input id="setSmsApiKey" class="form-control" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Leave blank to keep saved key"><div id="setSmsApiKeyHint" class="form-text"></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="setSmsSender">Sender ID (approved masked name / non-masking code)</label><input id="setSmsSender" class="form-control" maxlength="80" placeholder="Approved Sender ID"></div></div></div>
                    <div class="col-12" id="setSmsDeviceFields"><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-md-8"><label class="form-label" for="setSmsDeviceUrl">Outbound Webhook URL</label><input id="setSmsDeviceUrl" class="form-control" type="url" placeholder="https://your-device-webhook.example/send"></div><div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label" for="setSmsDeviceToken">Secret Key / Device Auth Token</label><input id="setSmsDeviceToken" class="form-control" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Leave blank to keep saved token"><div id="setSmsDeviceTokenHint" class="form-text"></div></div><div class="col-12"><div class="alert alert-info py-2 mb-0 small"><i class="bi bi-info-circle me-1"></i>Server will push recipient phone &amp; text payload to your phone, which dispatches it via SIM.</div></div></div></div>
                    <div class="col-12"><div id="setSmsDisabledNote" class="alert alert-secondary py-2 mb-0 small"><i class="bi bi-slash-circle me-1"></i>SMS delivery is disabled. No outbound messages will be sent.</div></div>
                  </div>
